# SITL's terrain cache (S36E149.DAT), written into the PROCESS's working directory -- so a sortie launched
# from the repo root leaves one here.  Runtime byproduct, never evidence: the mission's own terrain data is
# in worlds/, and each sortie keeps its own copy under logs/missionA-<tag>/terrain/.
terrain/
